2:T67c,<h2>Where You’ve Heard My Attenborough Voice</h2>
<p>My <strong>David Attenborough impression</strong> has been heard on <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/turkish-bird-attenborough-voice" class="isred" title="Social Media Attenborough style" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">social media campaigns</a>, the viral <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-impression" class="isred" title="Biffa Attenborough video" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Biffa video</a>, and across <strong>video games</strong> including <a href="/horizon-zero-dawn-voice" title="David Attenborough impersonation Video Game demo">Horizon Zero Dawn</a>. </p>

<p>Projects like <a href="/cracking-ice-david-attenborough-impression" title="Cracking Ice Attenborough Voice">Cracking Ice</a>, a tongue-in-cheek parody of nature docs, or the <a href="/natural-instincts-trailer-attenborough-voice" title="Natural Instincts Trailer Attenborough Voice">Natural Instincts trailer</a>. </p>

<p>From commercials and trailers to <a href="/character-voiceover" title="Character Voiceovers">character voiceover work</a> and <a href="/voiceover-cartoons" title="Cartoon Voiceovers">cartoons</a>, delivered with professionalism and humour.</p>

<!-- Mini Attenborough -->
<div style="margin:20px 0;">
  <audio controls style="width:100%; max-width:420px;">
