    David Attenborough Voice Showreel – Guy Harris
  </p>
</div>5:T4ba,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice#faq","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Who is the most famous wildlife narrator?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Sir David Attenborough is widely regarded as the most famous wildlife narrator, with a career spanning decades of natural history documentaries."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is David Attenborough's voice AI?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"While AI voice generators exist, Guy Harris provides a natural David Attenborough impression voiceover, delivering nuance and storytelling that AI cannot replicate."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is this Attenborough voice generated by AI?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. This is a real voiceover performed by award-winning British voice artist Guy Harris, using his own voice to create a natural, respectful Attenborough-style narration."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who has 32 honorary degrees?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Sir David Attenborough has been awarded 32 honorary degrees from universities worldwide, recognising his influence on broadcasting and education."}}]}0:["PTF5f6zbP51hXl6zOpnuH",[[["",{"children":["david-attenborough-voice",{"children":["__PAGE__",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["david-attenborough-voice",{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",["$","main",null,{"className":"inner-page","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h1>The UK’s Leading David Attenborough Voiceover Artist – Heard Worldwide</h1>\r\n<p>Looking for a realistic <strong>David Attenborough voiceover</strong>? You’ve found it. Recognised as one of the UK’s most trusted <strong>Attenborough sound-a-likes</strong>, my impression has been heard across TV, radio, games, trailers, and viral campaigns. Always delivered with respect, humour, and the detail clients expect.</p>"}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-bar"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-parallax","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","children":[[["$","div","0",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tODqlSVh6hc","title":"YouTube video","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"inner-row reverse","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Common Questions About My Attenborough Voice</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Is David Attenborough’s voice AI?</strong> No. While there are <a href=\"/ai-guy-human-vs-ai-voiceover\" title=\"AI Voices\">AI</a> versions out there, my impression is a natural performance, grounded in years of professional voiceover experience. I deliver nuance, timing and warmth that no algorithm can fully capture.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Where have people heard your Attenborough impression?</strong> Across TV, games, trailers, social virals, and more. From <a href=\"/turkish-bird-attenborough-voice\" title=\"Social Media Attenborough\">lighthearted social media videos</a> to serious narration worldwide.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Can you record live with direction?</strong> Absolutely. I record with clients over <a href=\"/voiceover-studio\" title=\"Booking Attenborough with Zoom or Cleanfeed\">Zoom or Cleanfeed</a>, so you can direct in real time. The final read is then exactly as you imagined it. All delivered in broadcast-quality audio the same day.</p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/diSuM7OMyGg","title":"YouTube video","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Ready to Book a David Attenborough Voice?</h2>\r\n<p>Want to play around with the style yourself?<br>Try my <a href=\"/attenborough-script-generator\" title=\"attenborough script generator\">David Attenborough Script Generator</a> for fun, AI-powered scripts. It’s a fun way to test script writing, but if your project matters, let’s keep it <strong>Human First</strong>.<br>If you’re after a respectful <strong>David Attenborough impersonator</strong>, whether serious narration or spoof comedy, drop me a message and I’ll send you a quick free sample before you commit. Most scripts are voiced the same day.</p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/images/attenborough-script-generator.jpg","alt":"David Attenborough Impression – Guy Harris","style":{"width":"100%","borderRadius":4,"marginTop":8}}]]}]]}]],["$","$L3",null,{"pageTitle":"David Attenborough Voice Impression - Guy Harris","pageUrl":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"generator-promo","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Try the Free Attenborough Script Generator"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Got a fun scenario in mind? Use the free Attenborough Script Generator to turn any scene into a nature-documentary-style narration. Then hire Guy Harris to voice the final script and bring it to life for real."}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/attenborough-script-generator","className":"generator-promo-btn","children":"Try the Attenborough Script Generator"}]]}]}],[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"ProfilePage\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice#profilepage\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice\",\"mainEntity\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/#guyharris\",\"name\":\"Guy Harris\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\",\"image\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png\",\"jobTitle\":\"British Male Voiceover Artist\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/voiceoverguy/\",\"https://www.youtube.com/user/voiceoverguyharris\"],\"description\":\"Guy Harris is an award-winning British male voiceover artist, known for his David Attenborough impression voiceovers used in TV, games, social campaigns and promos.\"}}"}}],["$","script","1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"item\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/\",\"name\":\"Home\"}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"item\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice\",\"name\":\"David Attenborough Voice\"}}]}"}}],["$","script","2",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"AudioObject\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice#audio\",\"name\":\"David Attenborough Voiceover Demo – Guy Harris\",\"description\":\"A natural David Attenborou